    "detailed_description": "Resonant is an open, rhythm based experience. Explore a world that breathes with sound, choosing your musical path to discover all that the landscape has to reveal. The game allows you to construct your own soundscapes, creating a puzzle-like experience where different melodic combinations create different movements and pathways throughout the world. Your journey will reveal everything that a marriage between nature and sound has to offer.",
